'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a cape and a [[player card]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
This [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|cosmetic set]], found on page 2nd of the [[Ironclad Democracy Premium Warbond]], can be claimed separately for  {{Currency|Medals|25}} and {{Currency|Medals|7|notext}}respectively

== Trivia ==
* The pattern on the back of the cape and near the top of the player card spells out “TANK” in morse code, from top to bottom on the cape and left to right on the player card.<ref>[https://www.reddit.com/r/LowSodiumHellDivers/s/l4UYP8myD5 r/LowSodiumHellDivers post - Very cool detail on the new "Shroud of the Juggernaut" cape.] posted by u/SgtGhost57</ref>

